      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T20:39:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "UTF-8 is the string encoding Go uses, with `rune` as the element type. It\u0027s the Go equivalent of the C `char`, except that it isn\u0027t guaranteed to correspond to a particular character; just a unicode point. I do this so as to translate between True/False and true/false for Bazel v. Soong.",
